From ae673b8639161454ed41474fa8fdc09f0084c864 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lacamar <lchlnm@pm.me>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:28:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Support iOS 26 and iTunes-era libraries

- Accept iOS 26 Music database (2350000)
- Tolerate orphan companion rows, absent anchor, no album artist
- Unsynced non-music items may hold files
- Files up to 1 GiB
- MP4: trimmed mdhd duration, music videos
- Compact and free-text release dates
- DisabledAssetTypes without Photo
- iOS 26 hex artwork tokens
- Skip unpreparable MP3s in candidates

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F3FjoJj4RV14hgXJuf9gh7
